  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2001.desc",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "With [councillor.GetTitledFirstNamePossessive] diligent administration of my household's finances, there is more gold at the end of this season than expected.\\n\\n",
    "RUS": "[councillor.GetTitledFirstName] отлично управляется с моими финансами: к концу этого сезона мы получаем больше золота, чем ожидалось.\\n\\n«Как нам лучше распорядиться доходом, [ROOT.Char.GetWifeHusband]?»",
    "POL": "[councillor.GetTitledFirstName] rzetelnie zarządza finansami mojego gospodarstwa domowego, a pod koniec tego sezonu mamy o wiele więcej złota, niż się spodziewaliśmy.\\n\\n„Jak najlepiej je wykorzystać, [Select_CString(ROOT.Char.IsFemale, 'żono', 'mężu' )]?”",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2001.a",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "Host a magnificent dinner party to the delight of all!",
    "RUS": "Устроить великолепный званый обед ко всеобщему восторгу!",
    "POL": "Zorganizuj wspaniałe przyjęcie ku uciesze wszystkich!",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship_2001_every_powerful_vassal",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "Every Powerful Vassal",
    "RUS": "Все могущественные вассалы",
    "POL": "Każdy wasal wpływowy",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2001.b",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "Invest the money in the local area.",
    "RUS": "Вложите деньги в область.",
    "POL": "Zainwestuj pieniądze w okolicę.",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2001.c",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "If there's one thing money can buy it's eyes and ears!",
    "RUS": "Если деньги что и могут купить, так это глаза и уши!",
    "POL": "Jeśli istnieje jedna rzecz, którą można kupić za pieniądze, to oczy i uszy!",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2001.d",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "Let's save it for now.",
    "RUS": "Давайте не будем их пока тратить.",
    "POL": "Zachowajmy je na razie.",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2002.t",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "Spouse: Glittering Opportunity",
    "RUS": "Спутник жизни: блестящая возможность",
    "POL": "Małżonek: wspaniała okazja",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2002.desc",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "",
    "RUS": "«[ROOT.Char.Custom('FormOfAddressForLiege')|U]! — [courtier_lender.GetTitledFirstName] шаркающей походкой подходит ко мне и [courtier_lender.Custom('quirk_pos_adverb')] улыбается. — Ко мне [Select_CString(councillor.IsFemale, 'обратилась', 'обратился' )] [councillor.GetTitledFirstName], в мудрости своей [Select_CString(councillor.IsFemale, 'предложившая', 'предложивший' )] заключить соглашение между нашими сторонами. Поскольку вы нуждаетесь в финансах, а я — в одобрении общества...»",
    "POL": "– Wasza czcigodność. – [courtier_lender.GetTitledFirstName] podchodzi do mnie i uśmiecha się [courtier_lender.Custom('quirk_pos_adverb')]. – [councillor.GetTitledFirstName] w swej mądrości sugeruje mi porozumienie między tobą i mną. Ponieważ tobie przydałaby się pomoc finansowa, a mnie pomoc socjalna…",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2002.a",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "I will repay you, I promise.",
    "RUS": "Я отплачу вам, даю слово.",
    "POL": "Odwdzięczę ci się, obiecuję.",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2002.money_loan_tooltip",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "I will borrow [gold_i] #bold [THIS.Var('amount_to_loan').GetValue]#! gold from [courtier_lender.GetFirstNameNoTooltip].",
    "RUS": "[courtier_lender.GetFirstNameNoTooltip] одолжит мне [gold_i] #bold  [THIS.Var('amount_to_loan').GetValue]#! золота.",
    "POL": "[courtier_lender.GetFirstNameNoTooltip] pożyczy mi [gold_i] #bold [THIS.Var('amount_to_loan').GetValue]#! złota.",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2002.b",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "Why don't you donate it to the [ROOT.Char.GetFaith.HouseOfWorship] instead?",
    "RUS": "Думаю, [ROOT.Char.GetFaith.HouseOfWorship] лучше распорядится вашим пожертвованием.",
    "POL": "Dlaczego zamiast tego nie przekażesz go na [ROOT.Char.GetFaith.HouseOfWorship]?",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2002.c",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "You should donate it to the poor.",
    "RUS": "Вам стоит пожертвовать это золото беднякам.",
    "POL": "Powin[Select_CString(courtier_lender.IsFemale, 'naś', 'ieneś' )] ofiarować je biednym.",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2002.d",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "I will gladly accept this tribute!",
    "RUS": "Я с радостью приму это подношение!",
    "POL": "Z przyjemnością przyjmę tę daninę!",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2003.t",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "Spouse: Opportunity for Trade",
    "RUS": "Спутник жизни: возможность для торговли",
    "POL": "Małżonek: okazja do handlu",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2003.desc",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "[councillor.GetTitledFirstName] approaches me with three scrolls of parchment in [councillor.GetHerHis] arms.\\n\\n",
    "RUS": "[councillor.GetTitledFirstName] подходит ко мне, сжимая в руках три свитка пергамента.\\n\\n«[ROOT.Char.Custom('FormOfAddressForLiege')|U], я хочу представить вам наброски торговых соглашений с соседними правителями. Мы наверняка сможем заключить сделку, от которой выиграют обе стороны!»",
    "POL": "[councillor.GetTitledFirstName] przychodzi do mnie z trzema zwojami pergaminu w rękach.\\n\\n– Wasza czcigodność, mam tu przygotowane propozycje handlowe dla sąsiednich władców. Z pewnością możemy zawrzeć umowę, która przyniesie korzyści obu stronom!",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2003.a",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "[ruler_1.GetTitledFirstNameNoTooltip] seems reasonable.",
    "RUS": "[ruler_1.GetTitledFirstNameNoTooltip] кажется здравомыслящим человеком.",
    "POL": "[ruler_1.GetTitledFirstNameNoTooltip] wydaje się rozsądn[Select_CString(ruler_1.IsFemale, 'a', 'y' )].",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2003.b",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "Enter in an agreement with [ruler_2.GetTitledFirstNameNoTooltip].",
    "RUS": "[ruler_2.GetTitledFirstNameNoTooltip] и я заключим соглашение.",
    "POL": "Ja i [ruler_2.GetTitledFirstNameNoTooltip] z pewnością się dogadamy.",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2003.c",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "Make a deal with [ruler_3.GetTitledFirstNameNoTooltip].",
    "RUS": "Сделку заключим я и [ruler_3.GetTitledFirstNameNoTooltip].",
    "POL": "[ruler_3.GetTitledFirstNameNoTooltip] i ja zawrzemy umowę.",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2003.d_greedy",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "None of them will come close to my gold!",
    "RUS": "Никто из них не приблизится к моему золоту!",
    "POL": "Żaden z nich nie ujrzy mego złota!",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2003.d_arrogant",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "None of them are worthy of a deal with #EMP me#!!",
    "RUS": "Никто из них не достоин вести переговоры со #EMP мной#!!",
    "POL": "Żaden z nich nie jest wart umowy ze #EMP mną#!!",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2003.d",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "None of them present a tempting enough opportunity...",
    "RUS": "Сделки с ними не представляют интереса...",
    "POL": "Żadna z nich nie jest wystarczająco kusząca…",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2004.t",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "Spouse: A Helping Hand",
    "RUS": "Спутник жизни: рука помощи",
    "POL": "Małżonek: pomocna dłoń",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2004.desc",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "",
    "RUS": "«[Select_CString(on_my_hook.IsFemale, 'Ваша', 'Ваш' )] [ROOT.Char.Custom2('RelationToMe', SCOPE.sC('on_my_hook'))] [on_my_hook.GetTitledFirstName] недавно [Select_CString(on_my_hook.IsFemale, 'оказалась', 'оказался' )] в беде».\\n\\n[councillor.GetTitledFirstName] [councillor.Custom('quirk_pos_adverb')] улыбается, а затем продолжает: «Мне удалось разрешить проблему и упомянуть, что благодарить за это [on_my_hook.GetTitledFirstName] [Select_CString(on_my_hook.IsFemale, 'должна', 'должен' )] вас».",
    "POL": "– [on_my_hook.GetTitledFirstName], dla mnie [ROOT.Char.Custom2('RelationToMe', SCOPE.sC('on_my_hook'))], regularnie wpada ostatnio w niezłe tarapaty.\\n\\n[councillor.GetTitledFirstName] uśmiecha się [councillor.Custom('quirk_pos_adverb')], po czym kontynuuje: – Mam już pewność, że sytuacja rozwiązała się sama, i to dzięki tobie.",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2004.a",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "Excellent work!",
    "RUS": "Отличная работа!",
    "POL": "Doskonała robota!",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2004.b",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/councillor_task_events/councillor_spouse_events/councillor_spouse_stewardship_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "A good deed needs no repayment.",
    "RUS": "Не нужно требовать награды за благие дела.",
    "POL": "Dobry uczynek nie wymaga spłaty.",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "councillor_spouse_stewardship.2005.t",
